  "description": "Turns an RFC 5322 message into a SensitiveDataGateway bundle: headers, every body part\n      of every alternative, attachments, and forwarded messages flattened with their lineage\n      intact. It decodes transfer encodings and charsets and does nothing else — it opens no\n      socket, follows no reference out of the message, and decrypts nothing.",
